{
 "encounter_id": "00996",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've been sick all night. Nausea since about ten, and I've vomited four times."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sorry to hear that. Let me ask a few things. Is it only vomiting, or diarrhoea as well?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just vomiting. Four times, between midnight and five."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you eat yesterday? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Takeaway curry, about eight in the evening. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did anyone else have it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My partner, but she's fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any previous conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Migraines. They also make me sick."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any tummy problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had gallstones."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me press your tummy. Tell me if it hurts.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Slightly, in the middle, up top. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft, with mild tenderness in the upper middle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That fits. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here's what I'd suggest, without making a big thing of it. Sip fluids little and often. Oral rehydration drinks are best."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How much? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few sips every five minutes, increasing as you tolerate. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid solid food for several hours, then try plain things, toast, rice."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And painkillers? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid anti-inflammatories for now, as they irritate the stomach. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rest, and wash your hands carefully so nobody else catches it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you can't keep fluids down for 24 hours, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thanks. ~"
  }
